# Local marketing/video source assets (100MB+ of .mov/.mp4). Deliverables are
# shared directly, not versioned -- GitHub rejects >100MB and warns over 50MB.
# Anchored with a leading "/": the unanchored "marketing/" also matched
# components/marketing/ (the site's marketing components), so git refused to
# add changes there and would have silently dropped any new file.
/marketing/

